(2847377, 395699, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep - clean, simple, nice bokeh background, sharp and well focused.  Put it in a frame!  ;^)  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep - clean, simple, nice bokeh background, sharp and well focused.  Put it in a frame!  ;^)  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-19 12:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847382, 396697, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little hot up top, green may have been pushed too far in saturation, and possibly could be a little sharper.  All that said, I still like it!  ;^)  Nice bokeh in the background.  I need to grow some of these so I don''t have to hunt for them when I need one to add to a photo.  :P<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'A little hot up top, green may have been pushed too far in saturation, and possibly could be a little sharper.  All that said, I still like it!  ;^)  Nice bokeh in the background.  I need to grow some of these so I don''t have to hunt for them when I need one to add to a photo.  :P Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-09-19 12:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
