(2847510, 397494, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  I really like the tone and contrast (sharp too!).  Very nice job of processing this.</td>', 'This is very cool.  I really like the tone and contrast (sharp too!).  Very nice job of processing this.', '2006-09-19 13:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847522, 395774, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Crisp, clear, interesting to look at.  I like the color tone you''ve selected (kicking myself - almost used this tone and chickened out).  Nice use of bg material to add, yet not impose, to the image overall.</td>', 'Nice.  Crisp, clear, interesting to look at.  I like the color tone you''ve selected (kicking myself - almost used this tone and chickened out).  Nice use of bg material to add, yet not impose, to the image overall.', '2006-09-19 13:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847530, 397355, 30049, '<td valign="top">Such a tricky thing to expose these dandelion heads correctly.  You''re near (perhaps over) the edge on being being overexposed in the highlights.  From looking at this I get the impression that this image is a crop of something larger.  Background is a little noisy and the "fluff" could be sharper.  There is one, maybe two others with dandelion heads that are nicely defined and sharp in this challenge.  For example - [thumb]395774[/thumb].<br/> <br/>All of the above is JMO of course.  Just trying to be honest.  ;^)</td>', 'Such a tricky thing to expose these dandelion heads correctly.  You''re near (perhaps over) the edge on being being overexposed in the highlights.  From looking at this I get the impression that this image is a crop of something larger.  Background is a little noisy and the "fluff" could be sharper.  There is one, maybe two others with dandelion heads that are nicely defined and sharp in this challenge.  For example - [thumb]395774[/thumb]. All of the above is JMO of course.  Just trying to be honest.  ;^)', '2006-09-19 13:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847563, 396114, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...where have I seen this ship before?  ;^)  It''s an interesting image, however I think you''re relying too much on the title to make the connection to the challenge theme.  JMO of course.</td>', 'Hmmm...where have I seen this ship before?  ;^)  It''s an interesting image, however I think you''re relying too much on the title to make the connection to the challenge theme.  JMO of course.', '2006-09-19 13:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2847640, 397473, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a finely sliced DOF line.  I like the low-key lighting for this.  Sharp, well-focused...  Not sure about the angle.  It adds interest but it''s giving me a stiff neck!  ;^)  Nicely done.</td>', 'That''s a finely sliced DOF line.  I like the low-key lighting for this.  Sharp, well-focused...  Not sure about the angle.  It adds interest but it''s giving me a stiff neck!  ;^)  Nicely done.', '2006-09-19 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
