(2849016, 396728, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and composed.  When acorns get like that (often when they sweat in plastic collecting bags for instance) then duotone or black and white is the order of the day.  Nicely done. 8.</td>', 'Nicely lit and composed.  When acorns get like that (often when they sweat in plastic collecting bags for instance) then duotone or black and white is the order of the day.  Nicely done. 8.', '2006-09-19 23:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849018, 397219, 51538, '<td valign="top">Clean image but I think a light coloured background would have been better.</td>', 'Clean image but I think a light coloured background would have been better.', '2006-09-19 23:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849024, 397288, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo and I can understand why one simply must show it.  But the connection to seed is very tentative in any language or interpretation thereof.</td>', 'Lovely photo and I can understand why one simply must show it.  But the connection to seed is very tentative in any language or interpretation thereof.', '2006-09-19 23:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849130, 397407, 65322, '<td valign="top">Those look like beans you cook with. xD LMAO.<br/>Anywayyysss. Great picture. I enjoyed the photoshoping. ; D <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'Those look like beans you cook with. xD LMAO.Anywayyysss. Great picture. I enjoyed the photoshoping. ; D Good Luck', '2006-09-19 23:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849178, 397444, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the dark rendition and lack of contrast in the shadow areas makes the acorns hard to see.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the dark rendition and lack of contrast in the shadow areas makes the acorns hard to see.', '2006-09-20 00:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849189, 396651, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and concept. I think it would be more effective with greater DOF; the out of focus shapes in the foreground are especially distracting.</td>', 'Interesting composition and concept. I think it would be more effective with greater DOF; the out of focus shapes in the foreground are especially distracting.', '2006-09-20 00:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849194, 395945, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color and detail. Each seed stands out.</td>', 'Brilliant color and detail. Each seed stands out.', '2006-09-20 00:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849201, 396848, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is there a seed hidden somewhere, or am I just missing something?</td>', 'Is there a seed hidden somewhere, or am I just missing something?', '2006-09-20 00:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849206, 396844, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice shading at the bottom. The white background in the middle and top seems stark by comparison.</td>', 'Nice colors, nice shading at the bottom. The white background in the middle and top seems stark by comparison.', '2006-09-20 00:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849210, 397008, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste it.</td>', 'I can almost taste it.', '2006-09-20 00:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849216, 396114, 12733, '<td valign="top">Or maybe silks, or cottons, or steel bolts. Putting seeds in the title of a picture of a ship doesn''t make the picture meet the challenge. Sorry bout that - it would really be a great photo in a different challenge.</td>', 'Or maybe silks, or cottons, or steel bolts. Putting seeds in the title of a picture of a ship doesn''t make the picture meet the challenge. Sorry bout that - it would really be a great photo in a different challenge.', '2006-09-20 00:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849218, 396404, 12733, '<td valign="top">You have some beautiful varieties of corn there, and you''ve captured the detail and color nicely.</td>', 'You have some beautiful varieties of corn there, and you''ve captured the detail and color nicely.', '2006-09-20 00:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849223, 397375, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the challenge is about the picture, not the title. And without the title, this would have nothing to do with seeds.</td>', 'Sorry, the challenge is about the picture, not the title. And without the title, this would have nothing to do with seeds.', '2006-09-20 00:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849225, 397201, 12733, '<td valign="top">pretty textures, nice blurred background.</td>', 'pretty textures, nice blurred background.', '2006-09-20 00:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849231, 397395, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s risky shooting something so colorful as avacoado and peppers in black and white, but you have pulled it off.</td>', 'It''s risky shooting something so colorful as avacoado and peppers in black and white, but you have pulled it off.', '2006-09-20 00:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849236, 397001, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very brilliant color and nice texture.</td>', 'Very brilliant color and nice texture.', '2006-09-20 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849245, 397451, 12733, '<td valign="top">Love the color of the apple and seeds. The table top is too white, though; it looks burnt out.</td>', 'Love the color of the apple and seeds. The table top is too white, though; it looks burnt out.', '2006-09-20 00:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849277, 397324, 60495, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good single tree entry, nice colors and great scenery.</td>', 'This would have been a good single tree entry, nice colors and great scenery.', '2006-09-20 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849280, 395116, 60495, '<td valign="top">Ugly yet beautiful...  6</td>', 'Ugly yet beautiful...  6', '2006-09-20 00:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849286, 397538, 60495, '<td valign="top">Not much popcorn, must be a short program rather than a football game.. Nicely done, might have been more effective with a bowl of popcorn but still very nice. 7</td>', 'Not much popcorn, must be a short program rather than a football game.. Nicely done, might have been more effective with a bowl of popcorn but still very nice. 7', '2006-09-20 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849294, 396749, 65570, '<td valign="top">I like the use of backlighting very nice photo</td>', 'I like the use of backlighting very nice photo', '2006-09-20 00:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849619, 397059, 39110, '<td valign="top">Love the title!</td>', 'Love the title!', '2006-09-20 02:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849767, 397461, 57936, '<td valign="top">Undoubtably seedy, but compositionally lacking. I would have either backed out to show the whole plate or cropped tighter to the food and had just the curve of the plate on the edge of the image (with a 6x4 ratio). Nice clarity and contrasting colors.</td>', 'Undoubtably seedy, but compositionally lacking. I would have either backed out to show the whole plate or cropped tighter to the food and had just the curve of the plate on the edge of the image (with a 6x4 ratio). Nice clarity and contrasting colors.', '2006-09-20 03:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849768, 396971, 57936, '<td valign="top">Loses focus toward the top of the mellon.</td>', 'Loses focus toward the top of the mellon.', '2006-09-20 03:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849770, 396999, 57936, '<td valign="top">At first I was gonna knock this, but I like the interpretation of the seed concept here! Very nice image. I would prefer a bit longer DOF. the trees in the intermediate area are a bit out of focus (or just soft...)</td>', 'At first I was gonna knock this, but I like the interpretation of the seed concept here! Very nice image. I would prefer a bit longer DOF. the trees in the intermediate area are a bit out of focus (or just soft...)', '2006-09-20 03:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849773, 397343, 57936, '<td valign="top">I did just about the same thing with a Thistle plant for my image. I like the way you caught a couple about to escape the others. I ran out of patience (and lunch time) to catch that with my thistle plant. The only nit pick is that I would like to see a bit sharper focus on the milkweed and less distracting background. The bright green on the far left and the transition from bright green to brown in the middle are troublesome.</td>', 'I did just about the same thing with a Thistle plant for my image. I like the way you caught a couple about to escape the others. I ran out of patience (and lunch time) to catch that with my thistle plant. The only nit pick is that I would like to see a bit sharper focus on the milkweed and less distracting background. The bright green on the far left and the transition from bright green to brown in the middle are troublesome.', '2006-09-20 03:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849775, 397306, 57936, '<td valign="top">This is a bit oversharpened. The plant itself is ok, but the blur in the background is a bit funky in a way that suggests too much USM was used.</td>', 'This is a bit oversharpened. The plant itself is ok, but the blur in the background is a bit funky in a way that suggests too much USM was used.', '2006-09-20 03:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849778, 396641, 57936, '<td valign="top">WOW Great clarity! I only wish the background was a bit more smooth. The bright spot in the center top is a bit distracting.</td>', 'WOW Great clarity! I only wish the background was a bit more smooth. The bright spot in the center top is a bit distracting.', '2006-09-20 03:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849780, 396635, 57936, '<td valign="top">Lacks contrast and is a bit soft at the back.</td>', 'Lacks contrast and is a bit soft at the back.', '2006-09-20 03:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849781, 397277, 57936, '<td valign="top">This lacks contrast for a B&amp;W conversion. I would prefer to see it in color or have more variation in the tones.</td>', 'This lacks contrast for a B&W conversion. I would prefer to see it in color or have more variation in the tones.', '2006-09-20 03:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849784, 397040, 57936, '<td valign="top">It is unclear what the brown thing between the two fluffy green seeds are. If it is a branch, I think it should have been eliminated. If it is another type of seed with natural armor, it needs to be presented more focally. Also, this would be improved by longer DOF. I know that the shallow DOF was intentional, but my personal preference would be to have both seeds presented with sharp detail. There just isn''t enough background for an artistic DOF with bokeh look here... But that is probably just me! :)</td>', 'It is unclear what the brown thing between the two fluffy green seeds are. If it is a branch, I think it should have been eliminated. If it is another type of seed with natural armor, it needs to be presented more focally. Also, this would be improved by longer DOF. I know that the shallow DOF was intentional, but my personal preference would be to have both seeds presented with sharp detail. There just isn''t enough background for an artistic DOF with bokeh look here... But that is probably just me! :)', '2006-09-20 03:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849786, 397007, 57936, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I''m having trouble getting the seed aspect to this. I know the plants have seeds on them, but they don''t seem to be the real subject of the image... This is a beautiful shot! The sky is tremendous! It just isn''t seedy enough... (Wonder how many times that pun is gonna be used in this challenge! LOL!)</td>', 'Hmmm. I''m having trouble getting the seed aspect to this. I know the plants have seeds on them, but they don''t seem to be the real subject of the image... This is a beautiful shot! The sky is tremendous! It just isn''t seedy enough... (Wonder how many times that pun is gonna be used in this challenge! LOL!)', '2006-09-20 03:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849787, 397364, 57936, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, double meanings here? LOL</td>', 'Hmmmm, double meanings here? LOL', '2006-09-20 03:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849790, 397286, 57936, '<td valign="top">Needs just a touch more contrast. It is too hard to pick out the green on green pine-cone.</td>', 'Needs just a touch more contrast. It is too hard to pick out the green on green pine-cone.', '2006-09-20 03:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849792, 395774, 57936, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV. THe outside of the puff ball is a bit funky, probably a bit too much USM. I also can''t figure for the life of me what the dandilion is flopped over, and it''s bright top distracts from the main thrust of the image.</td>', 'Interesting POV. THe outside of the puff ball is a bit funky, probably a bit too much USM. I also can''t figure for the life of me what the dandilion is flopped over, and it''s bright top distracts from the main thrust of the image.', '2006-09-20 03:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849796, 396848, 57936, '<td valign="top">OK, I just don''t get what this has to do with the seed challenge... I might be daft, but there you go!<br/> <br/>Also, the uneven background with the car on one side and the almost legible but not quite lettering on the building is too busy. A Shallower DOF rendering the background a creamy blur would serve the image better.</td>', 'OK, I just don''t get what this has to do with the seed challenge... I might be daft, but there you go! Also, the uneven background with the car on one side and the almost legible but not quite lettering on the building is too busy. A Shallower DOF rendering the background a creamy blur would serve the image better.', '2006-09-20 03:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849797, 397008, 57936, '<td valign="top">A bit blown out on the left. Lacks focus near the bottom.</td>', 'A bit blown out on the left. Lacks focus near the bottom.', '2006-09-20 03:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849798, 397393, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation. It would be nice if you had a bit longer or shorter DOF and a more interesting sky. The weather in this picture is enough to stiffle anyones wanderlust! :)</td>', 'Nice interpretation. It would be nice if you had a bit longer or shorter DOF and a more interesting sky. The weather in this picture is enough to stiffle anyones wanderlust! :)', '2006-09-20 03:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849802, 396374, 57936, '<td valign="top">OK, I''ll bite. What does a boat for sale have to do with seed... I can think of some options, but none that are really implied by the image or the title...</td>', 'OK, I''ll bite. What does a boat for sale have to do with seed... I can think of some options, but none that are really implied by the image or the title...', '2006-09-20 03:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849803, 396404, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, very seedy, but a bit too busy.</td>', 'Nice colors, very seedy, but a bit too busy.', '2006-09-20 03:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849808, 397295, 57936, '<td valign="top">Just a touch too little DOF or misplaced focus. The front stalks that are blurry hurt the image.</td>', 'Just a touch too little DOF or misplaced focus. The front stalks that are blurry hurt the image.', '2006-09-20 03:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2849811, 397328, 57936, '<td valign="top">OK, I don''t know what those are, but it is funny!</td>', 'OK, I don''t know what those are, but it is funny!', '2006-09-20 03:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850136, 397305, 50357, '<td valign="top">Crisp color, nicely arranged, nice border.  Very nice.</td>', 'Crisp color, nicely arranged, nice border.  Very nice.', '2006-09-20 08:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850137, 397554, 50357, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I would have liked to have seen the entire pod.</td>', 'Very nice, I would have liked to have seen the entire pod.', '2006-09-20 08:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850139, 397277, 50357, '<td valign="top">A little too dark, but creative.</td>', 'A little too dark, but creative.', '2006-09-20 08:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850141, 396404, 50357, '<td valign="top">It seems just a little busy to me, but nice color, sharp image.</td>', 'It seems just a little busy to me, but nice color, sharp image.', '2006-09-20 08:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850142, 397395, 50357, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white.', '2006-09-20 08:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850143, 397479, 50357, '<td valign="top">Creative and different.</td>', 'Creative and different.', '2006-09-20 08:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850147, 395774, 50357, '<td valign="top">Nicely titled.  Different</td>', 'Nicely titled.  Different', '2006-09-20 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850150, 395934, 50357, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2006-09-20 08:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850152, 397288, 50357, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting use of the challenge!', '2006-09-20 08:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850473, 397554, 51538, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice - including the pod and the flying seed works well - but the light is a little dark for my liking.</td>', 'Composition is nice - including the pod and the flying seed works well - but the light is a little dark for my liking.', '2006-09-20 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850475, 396405, 51538, '<td valign="top">Considering the seeds are in the middle of the flower, you''re doubly covered.</td>', 'Considering the seeds are in the middle of the flower, you''re doubly covered.', '2006-09-20 10:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850476, 397470, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice counterpoint in colours.</td>', 'Nice counterpoint in colours.', '2006-09-20 10:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850479, 397064, 51538, '<td valign="top">My initial thought was: "Another one."  Howver, if I avoid thinking of cliches and simply look at the image for what it is, I can say it is cleanly executed and the title tolerably enhances it.</td>', 'My initial thought was: "Another one."  Howver, if I avoid thinking of cliches and simply look at the image for what it is, I can say it is cleanly executed and the title tolerably enhances it.', '2006-09-20 10:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850481, 396641, 51538, '<td valign="top">Delightful texture and tone. 9.</td>', 'Delightful texture and tone. 9.', '2006-09-20 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850482, 397345, 51538, '<td valign="top">A spoonful of sugar goes a long, long way...  Nice allusion and quiet, modest, but nicely presented photo. 8.</td>', 'A spoonful of sugar goes a long, long way...  Nice allusion and quiet, modest, but nicely presented photo. 8.', '2006-09-20 10:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850484, 395618, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and colours.</td>', 'Nice detail and colours.', '2006-09-20 10:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850486, 396775, 51538, '<td valign="top">Peppercorns and star aniseed.  Would have liked the lower part to be more active in some way.</td>', 'Peppercorns and star aniseed.  Would have liked the lower part to be more active in some way.', '2006-09-20 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850488, 395740, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and good creative idea. 8.</td>', 'Nicely done and good creative idea. 8.', '2006-09-20 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850491, 397007, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty sight and the grass is seeding. 7.5</td>', 'Pretty sight and the grass is seeding. 7.5', '2006-09-20 10:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850493, 397242, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very funny.</td>', 'Very funny.', '2006-09-20 10:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850494, 397499, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.</td>', 'Nicely composed.', '2006-09-20 10:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850618, 396374, 33672, '<td valign="top">I think I''m missing something here. Nice photo albiet a bit busy.</td>', 'I think I''m missing something here. Nice photo albiet a bit busy.', '2006-09-20 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850622, 397473, 33672, '<td valign="top">Extremely nice tones and dof on this. Comp and perspective are particularly interesting too.</td>', 'Extremely nice tones and dof on this. Comp and perspective are particularly interesting too.', '2006-09-20 11:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850772, 397219, 35545, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Good idea, but it looks to me as if the processing went off track.  The avocado seed looks fine, but the avocado flesh is off.  It has a translucent quality.  Reminds me more of a melon.  8(</td>', 'Hmmm.  Good idea, but it looks to me as if the processing went off track.  The avocado seed looks fine, but the avocado flesh is off.  It has a translucent quality.  Reminds me more of a melon.  8(', '2006-09-20 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850778, 397242, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is a great sheep picture, but without the title, I''d never have associated it with the sheep challenge.  You should have used it in the Gary Larson challenge.</td>', 'This is a great sheep picture, but without the title, I''d never have associated it with the sheep challenge.  You should have used it in the Gary Larson challenge.', '2006-09-20 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850786, 397401, 27524, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and background...like the contrast of your dark seeds.</td>', 'Lovely colors and background...like the contrast of your dark seeds.', '2006-09-20 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850799, 397494, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its great b&amp;w...nice contrast and focus. The outer frame is already very enough for me.</td>', 'Its great b&w...nice contrast and focus. The outer frame is already very enough for me.', '2006-09-20 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850804, 397092, 42683, '<td valign="top">Super atmosphere.</td>', 'Super atmosphere.', '2006-09-20 12:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850805, 397473, 27524, '<td valign="top">Just love it... dark but works well...the tilted angle is interesting also.</td>', 'Just love it... dark but works well...the tilted angle is interesting also.', '2006-09-20 12:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850825, 397153, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very grean and rich colors... lovely focus.</td>', 'Very grean and rich colors... lovely focus.', '2006-09-20 12:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850885, 397470, 33672, '<td valign="top">Incredible tones and and great PP. A lot of great texture! (and the start of a great guacamole perhaps:-})  10</td>', 'Incredible tones and and great PP. A lot of great texture! (and the start of a great guacamole perhaps:-})  10', '2006-09-20 12:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850887, 397459, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great idea! However it seems a bit too "Set up". Great lighting and texture though.</td>', 'Great idea! However it seems a bit too "Set up". Great lighting and texture though.', '2006-09-20 12:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851120, 397509, 57849, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. absolutely wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful. absolutely wonderful.', '2006-09-20 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2851576, 394611, 61131, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture. Excellent find. Very nice composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture. Excellent find. Very nice composition.', '2006-09-20 16:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
