(2855919, 397473, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the rich dark tones. DOF is used well here to pull the viewer into the subjects. Well done, 10 from me.</td>', 'Love the angle and the rich dark tones. DOF is used well here to pull the viewer into the subjects. Well done, 10 from me.', '2006-09-22 03:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855920, 397394, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing sharpness here. DOF also works well in this shot to pull the viewer to our main subject hanging on for dear life. Well done.</td>', 'Amazing sharpness here. DOF also works well in this shot to pull the viewer to our main subject hanging on for dear life. Well done.', '2006-09-22 03:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855923, 395774, 39349, '<td valign="top">Oh man, where do I start? THIS IS AMAZING!! Awesome duo-tone, DOF really works well here. Good use of the ROT. Nothing more to say than 10 for this stunning work. Very NICE!</td>', 'Oh man, where do I start? THIS IS AMAZING!! Awesome duo-tone, DOF really works well here. Good use of the ROT. Nothing more to say than 10 for this stunning work. Very NICE!', '2006-09-22 03:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855924, 396655, 39349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture in every way. I can''t imagine the patience you must have to get this one of a kind shot. Bravo!</td>', 'Wonderful capture in every way. I can''t imagine the patience you must have to get this one of a kind shot. Bravo!', '2006-09-22 03:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855925, 397470, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really like how you processed this shot. Gives it a real life feel. Good composition and lighting. Well done.</td>', 'I really like how you processed this shot. Gives it a real life feel. Good composition and lighting. Well done.', '2006-09-22 03:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855926, 397127, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is another one of my top picks for the front page. Great lighting and composition. I wonder if people are saying anything about the blade of grass behind our main subject? Not to worry, this viewer doesn''t mind it at all. Well done.</td>', 'This is another one of my top picks for the front page. Great lighting and composition. I wonder if people are saying anything about the blade of grass behind our main subject? Not to worry, this viewer doesn''t mind it at all. Well done.', '2006-09-22 03:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2855927, 396030, 39349, '<td valign="top">DOF really makes this shot for me, along with the rich deep b/w tones. This shot really does live up to the noir film feeling. Well done, 10 from this viewer.</td>', 'DOF really makes this shot for me, along with the rich deep b/w tones. This shot really does live up to the noir film feeling. Well done, 10 from this viewer.', '2006-09-22 03:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
