(2860873, 396848, 15032, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF but am not sure how this relates to the challenge.  Maybe I am missing something.</td>', 'I like the DOF but am not sure how this relates to the challenge.  Maybe I am missing something.', '2006-09-24 15:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2860874, 396374, 15032, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this fits in with seeds, maybe I am missing something...</td>', 'I''m not sure how this fits in with seeds, maybe I am missing something...', '2006-09-24 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861047, 397300, 30049, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that the truth!  ;^)  Nice composition.  Really like the bokeh.  Looks a bit oversharpened from where I sit.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Isn''t that the truth!  ;^)  Nice composition.  Really like the bokeh.  Looks a bit oversharpened from where I sit.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-24 18:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861049, 397559, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, sharp, and well thought out.  Should do well with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Clean, sharp, and well thought out.  Should do well with this.  Good luck.', '2006-09-24 18:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861052, 397342, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is "ok".  I think the subject material you''re working with has a little bit more potential with some lighting that is more dramatic.  Nice tones and textures to look at here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is "ok".  I think the subject material you''re working with has a little bit more potential with some lighting that is more dramatic.  Nice tones and textures to look at here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-24 18:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861054, 397502, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice tone, good message.  I think for some you''re going to run into monitor calibration issues ("too dark", etc...).  Only minor glitch for me is I think you should have gone a tad deeper on DOF.  Most of the egg, if not all, should be in focus IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice tone, good message.  I think for some you''re going to run into monitor calibration issues ("too dark", etc...).  Only minor glitch for me is I think you should have gone a tad deeper on DOF.  Most of the egg, if not all, should be in focus IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-24 18:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861059, 395618, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good subject, harsh lighting.  If you could have waited a little longer (provided you weren''t out in the morning - then make it earlier), the lighting on this wouldn''t have been quite so strong.  May consider taking something to add a little fill light when out shooting also like a piece of white paper or aluminum foil to fill in the shadows a little.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good subject, harsh lighting.  If you could have waited a little longer (provided you weren''t out in the morning - then make it earlier), the lighting on this wouldn''t have been quite so strong.  May consider taking something to add a little fill light when out shooting also like a piece of white paper or aluminum foil to fill in the shadows a little.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-24 18:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861293, 395699, 53465, '<td valign="top">great dof</td>', 'great dof', '2006-09-24 20:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2861306, 397461, 12733, '<td valign="top">The plate makes a pretty background and complements the tomato color nicely.</td>', 'The plate makes a pretty background and complements the tomato color nicely.', '2006-09-24 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
