(2862155, 396374, 40344, '<td valign="top">Well, I sure blew it with this one!!  Everyone or one hundred percent of commentors can''t be wrong, nobody got the title or the photo''s relationship to the challenge topic. Thank-you to everyone who commented, I learned a lot from the comments; if the photo has to be explained then it''s not a good representation of the subject.<br/> <br/>To any one who may even be remotely interested in my thinking(and lack of judgement)about this photo as related to the subject of "seeds", I saw this boat for sale and thought that this might be the seed of an idea that could potentially lead to a summer of boating. <br/> <br/>Is there at least a tattered piece of yarn  for last place? or is this what the brown ribbon is?</td>', 'Well, I sure blew it with this one!!  Everyone or one hundred percent of commentors can''t be wrong, nobody got the title or the photo''s relationship to the challenge topic. Thank-you to everyone who commented, I learned a lot from the comments; if the photo has to be explained then it''s not a good representation of the subject. To any one who may even be remotely interested in my thinking(and lack of judgement)about this photo as related to the subject of "seeds", I saw this boat for sale and thought that this might be the seed of an idea that could potentially lead to a summer of boating.  Is there at least a tattered piece of yarn  for last place? or is this what the brown ribbon is?', '2006-09-25 01:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2862158, 396997, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Focus is nice and sharp.  Depth of field is OK.  Though a shallower depth of field to soften the background, starting at the wrists, would have been an idea that may have served well.  Holding the arms closer together to block out the lighter area that starts at the joining of the hands would work well too.<br/> <br/>Photo is a little on the dark side for the subject.  Seeds usually represent life, fertility, growth etc.  Had you taken the hands and dirt to black and white, the seeds and seed pod would have really popped here.<br/> <br/>Overall I''ve enjoyed this picture, and it makes a nice statement.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Focus is nice and sharp.  Depth of field is OK.  Though a shallower depth of field to soften the background, starting at the wrists, would have been an idea that may have served well.  Holding the arms closer together to block out the lighter area that starts at the joining of the hands would work well too. Photo is a little on the dark side for the subject.  Seeds usually represent life, fertility, growth etc.  Had you taken the hands and dirt to black and white, the seeds and seed pod would have really popped here. Overall I''ve enjoyed this picture, and it makes a nice statement.', '2006-09-25 01:55:38.000000', NULL, 0),
