(2862365, 396655, 40718, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> What a boring, primitive image.  The composition is nonexistent - the two objects are just stuck each in their own side of the frame, flat against a boring background.  The whole picture is completely static.  There is definitely no sense of "escape". </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I love it.  At least I got more words from you than in my Zen shot.  Next time I''ll take it more seriously if you leave a comment <i>before</i> the challenge is over.  You look too reactionary this way...</td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: What a boring, primitive image.  The composition is nonexistent - the two objects are just stuck each in their own side of the frame, flat against a boring background.  The whole picture is completely static.  There is definitely no sense of "escape".   I love it.  At least I got more words from you than in my Zen shot.  Next time I''ll take it more seriously if you leave a comment before the challenge is over.  You look too reactionary this way...', '2006-09-25 03:18:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2862369, 397305, 48890, '<td valign="top">Why blacking out the background?  This could have been a pretty nice still life, but you turned it into a stock image. :(  Also, the light from the right is too harsh - the stalk and some of the seeds are too bright, loosing the subtle semitones which are usually so pleasant to look at in this sort of pictures.</td>', 'Why blacking out the background?  This could have been a pretty nice still life, but you turned it into a stock image. :(  Also, the light from the right is too harsh - the stalk and some of the seeds are too bright, loosing the subtle semitones which are usually so pleasant to look at in this sort of pictures.', '2006-09-25 03:24:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2862372, 396655, 18450, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus, dof and perfect timing!!! Wicked shot!! Congrats on your well deserved ribbon Dr!!</td>', 'Excellent focus, dof and perfect timing!!! Wicked shot!! Congrats on your well deserved ribbon Dr!!', '2006-09-25 03:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2862373, 396655, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i>I love it.  At least I got more words from you than in my Zen shot.  Next time I''ll take it more seriously if you leave a comment <i>before</i> the challenge is over.  You look too reactionary this way... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I would never comment on an image like this during the voting stage.  I would have given it a four, and moved on (although I did not vote in this challenge): I can''t afford commenting on every four I give.  Whether to take me seriously or not - is definitely up to you.</td>', 'Originally posted by DrAchoo:I love it.  At least I got more words from you than in my Zen shot.  Next time I''ll take it more seriously if you leave a comment before the challenge is over.  You look too reactionary this way...  I would never comment on an image like this during the voting stage.  I would have given it a four, and moved on (although I did not vote in this challenge): I can''t afford commenting on every four I give.  Whether to take me seriously or not - is definitely up to you.', '2006-09-25 03:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
