(2862832, 395012, 30982, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6 in voting, though I''m not sure why I didn''t go back and bump it up to a 7, now that I look at it again.  I liked the composition and monochromatic nature of the shot; technically it''s find to me.  In reading your description, I wouldn''t have known it was a flower - looks like a seed pod of some kind to me (which is fine, since that''s pretty much what you were after, I think.)</td>', 'I gave it a 6 in voting, though I''m not sure why I didn''t go back and bump it up to a 7, now that I look at it again.  I liked the composition and monochromatic nature of the shot; technically it''s find to me.  In reading your description, I wouldn''t have known it was a flower - looks like a seed pod of some kind to me (which is fine, since that''s pretty much what you were after, I think.)', '2006-09-25 10:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
