(2862992, 396374, 39057, '<td valign="top">Believe it or not...I did "get it". My interpetation was that the for sale sign planted the seed that would start you on a path to buying a boat...not necessarily that boat but maybe another one!<br/> <br/>Kenskid<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Geee:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, I sure blew it with this one!!  Everyone or one hundred percent of commentors can''t be wrong, nobody got the title or the photo''s relationship to the challenge topic. Thank-you to everyone who commented, I learned a lot from the comments; if the photo has to be explained then it''s not a good representation of the subject.<br/> <br/>To any one who may even be remotely interested in my thinking(and lack of judgement)about this photo as related to the subject of "seeds", I saw this boat for sale and thought that this might be the seed of an idea that could potentially lead to a summer of boating. <br/> <br/>Is there at least a tattered piece of yarn  for last place? or is this what the brown ribbon is? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Believe it or not...I did "get it". My interpetation was that the for sale sign planted the seed that would start you on a path to buying a boat...not necessarily that boat but maybe another one! Kenskid Originally posted by Geee: Well, I sure blew it with this one!!  Everyone or one hundred percent of commentors can''t be wrong, nobody got the title or the photo''s relationship to the challenge topic. Thank-you to everyone who commented, I learned a lot from the comments; if the photo has to be explained then it''s not a good representation of the subject. To any one who may even be remotely interested in my thinking(and lack of judgement)about this photo as related to the subject of "seeds", I saw this boat for sale and thought that this might be the seed of an idea that could potentially lead to a summer of boating.  Is there at least a tattered piece of yarn  for last place? or is this what the brown ribbon is? ', '2006-09-25 11:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
