(2863168, 397369, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Love your image, it''s well deserving of being on the front page IMO.  Very creative and great execution.</td>', 'Congratulations!  Love your image, it''s well deserving of being on the front page IMO.  Very creative and great execution.', '2006-09-25 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2863172, 397305, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, lovely still-life!  I wish it were on the front page.  Love the little bit of newspaper showing.  The composition is excellent, and so are the colours.  Congratulations!<br/> <br/>Added:  I really like your username too, it''s so gentle.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-25 11:55:44.</i></td>', 'This is a lovely, lovely still-life!  I wish it were on the front page.  Love the little bit of newspaper showing.  The composition is excellent, and so are the colours.  Congratulations! Added:  I really like your username too, it''s so gentle.', '2006-09-25 12:55:17.000000', '2006-09-25 12:55:44.000000', 0),
(2863198, 397288, 49326, '<td valign="top">Vá þetta er snilldar mynd. Ég veit ekki alveg hvernig, hún hefur bara einhvernveginn þau áhrif á mig að hún sé mjög góð. Ég held þetta sé vegna myndbyggingarinnar.</td>', 'Vá þetta er snilldar mynd. Ég veit ekki alveg hvernig, hún hefur bara einhvernveginn þau áhrif á mig að hún sé mjög góð. Ég held þetta sé vegna myndbyggingarinnar.', '2006-09-25 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2863218, 395012, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''d say "b) The photo presented conflicting thoughts or messages, and voters were left unsure of what to comment."<br/> <br/>I find the photo unpleasant. Unattractive colors. Seeds that look like raisins. Foreground that is OOF and blown. But the title would imply that was what you were trying to achieve.<br/> <br/>It is surprising that you didn''t get any comments on this.</td>', 'I''d say "b) The photo presented conflicting thoughts or messages, and voters were left unsure of what to comment." I find the photo unpleasant. Unattractive colors. Seeds that look like raisins. Foreground that is OOF and blown. But the title would imply that was what you were trying to achieve. It is surprising that you didn''t get any comments on this.', '2006-09-25 13:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2863275, 395774, 36371, '<td valign="top">Good shot. But, could you please post the original? I''d like to see what it looked like before all the adjusting. <br/></td>', 'Good shot. But, could you please post the original? I''d like to see what it looked like before all the adjusting. ', '2006-09-25 13:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2863291, 395012, 58452, '<td valign="top">I know when I don''t get many comments that the subject is just not appealing to the voters.  My abstract macro is experiencing this right now.  I won''t got into the technicals on yours as others have.  I don''t know what your subject is..... it''s kinda blah.  I believe that the hill of sand or salt had some potential with the right lighting and subject to go with it.  I think it scored fairly well, but I would, I seldom score over 5.5.  ;)<br/>Good luck on your next one.</td>', 'I know when I don''t get many comments that the subject is just not appealing to the voters.  My abstract macro is experiencing this right now.  I won''t got into the technicals on yours as others have.  I don''t know what your subject is..... it''s kinda blah.  I believe that the hill of sand or salt had some potential with the right lighting and subject to go with it.  I think it scored fairly well, but I would, I seldom score over 5.5.  ;)Good luck on your next one.', '2006-09-25 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2863300, 395774, 57882, '<td valign="top">Awesome results.  The lighting is magical.  I really get a feeling of some great sacrafice that resulted in something even greater than itself - if that makes any sense.  Very well deserved medal.</td>', 'Awesome results.  The lighting is magical.  I really get a feeling of some great sacrafice that resulted in something even greater than itself - if that makes any sense.  Very well deserved medal.', '2006-09-25 13:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
