(2863439, 396734, 18552, '<td valign="top">Van, this is so cute! I love the way the squirrel is biting the feeder - it just looks like it could be saying a little cuss word there! Is this in your yard? We don''t have any squirrels in La Jara - they live in Alamosa but not here for some reason.</td>', 'Van, this is so cute! I love the way the squirrel is biting the feeder - it just looks like it could be saying a little cuss word there! Is this in your yard? We don''t have any squirrels in La Jara - they live in Alamosa but not here for some reason.', '2006-09-25 14:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
