(2872993, 397364, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  lighting is well done, no blown highlights.  Composition is fairly static and probably could have been livened up.  A diagonal approach with more curve to the tail?  Maybe even an "egg" to give a bit of an action feel.<br/> <br/>Feel:  A cute idea, but sesame seeds don''t have a lot to do with sperm, eh?  So while it certainly meets the challenge on more than one level, the connections feel forced.  The static composition leads to a static feel.<br/> <br/>The Game: I''m not sure sperm is a winner on DPC. :)  I applaud your creativity however and say keep it up.</td>', 'Technicals:  lighting is well done, no blown highlights.  Composition is fairly static and probably could have been livened up.  A diagonal approach with more curve to the tail?  Maybe even an "egg" to give a bit of an action feel. Feel:  A cute idea, but sesame seeds don''t have a lot to do with sperm, eh?  So while it certainly meets the challenge on more than one level, the connections feel forced.  The static composition leads to a static feel. The Game: I''m not sure sperm is a winner on DPC. :)  I applaud your creativity however and say keep it up.', '2006-09-28 15:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
