(2892353, 397425, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the seed is hinted at - peeking out.  Nice job of a solid, supporting background, as well, and the DOF is good to get both halves of the apple focused.  I think I''d have preferred to see the face of the apple at just a bit more of an angle, though, rather than dead on towards the camera - it would add a bit more texture that way.</td>', 'I like how the seed is hinted at - peeking out.  Nice job of a solid, supporting background, as well, and the DOF is good to get both halves of the apple focused.  I think I''d have preferred to see the face of the apple at just a bit more of an angle, though, rather than dead on towards the camera - it would add a bit more texture that way.', '2006-10-03 19:24:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2892412, 396631, 30982, '<td valign="top">This poor guy is probably getting very tired of seeing the inside of your refrigerator.  I''m surprised he hasn''t moved to the neighbor''s yard yet!  But you do a very good job of shooting him (or her, as the case may be.)  Nice setup, nice shot, nice score, nice finish.</td>', 'This poor guy is probably getting very tired of seeing the inside of your refrigerator.  I''m surprised he hasn''t moved to the neighbor''s yard yet!  But you do a very good job of shooting him (or her, as the case may be.)  Nice setup, nice shot, nice score, nice finish.', '2006-10-03 19:45:39.000000', NULL, 0),
