(2926451, 396400, 48389, '<td valign="top"><b>Composition:</b> <br/> <br/>I like your choice of background colour but feel the seed should be more off to the left with less room at the bottom. A bit like this but with more room on the right I think....<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=410911" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48389/thumb/410911.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48389/thumb/410911.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/48389/thumb/410911.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><b>Technicals:</b> <br/> <br/>Good use of DOF to select just the section of the image with the seed in to be in focus but (unless its my eyes) the seed itself looks out of focus? The lighting on the seed is good and I feel you have managed the whites in the well.<br/> <br/>Just my opinion :o)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Composition:  I like your choice of background colour but feel the seed should be more off to the left with less room at the bottom. A bit like this but with more room on the right I think....   Technicals:  Good use of DOF to select just the section of the image with the seed in to be in focus but (unless its my eyes) the seed itself looks out of focus? The lighting on the seed is good and I feel you have managed the whites in the well. Just my opinion :o) ', '2006-10-13 17:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
